    35	
    36	Two pre-specified rules govern which terms enter in each cohort. A spline term is
    37	dropped where its correlation with age reaches 0.999 (fires on `sp18`, `sp30` in
    38	UK Biobank only). A binary predictor is scored only where both levels hold at
